{
  "name": "WF4 Compensation Refund (Full)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF4 · Compensation & Refund\n\nWebhook: `delivery.late` · `order.failed` (Header Auth)\n\nPolicy:\n- Late voucher auto: Rp10k / Rp25k (≥20 min late)\n- Refund = `total_amount`; ≥ Rp100k → Ops Telegram approval\n- Idempotency-Key + ON CONFLICT (event once)\n- Decline → no Payment call\n- Payment retryOnFail; hard fail → dead-letter\n\nVPS approval: Approve Within Chat + Show Outcome.",
        "height": 696,
        "width": 2752,
        "color": "#593A3A"
      },
      "id": "a3dfa87f-e58d-4bab-a265-a67ece1841af",
      "name": "Note · Compensation & Refund",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json;\nconst body = raw.body ?? raw;\nreturn [{ json: body }];"
      },
      "id": "95825497-9b0b-4649-8661-167f4a883b2e",
      "name": "Normalize Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        528,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT order_id, merchant_id, total_amount, payment_status, status\nFROM core.orders\nWHERE order_id = '{{ $json.order_id }}';",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "be8d7321-5b98-448e-bdc3-307fe84e141e",
      "name": "Load Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        752,
        352
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "GANTI-ID-PG-READER",
          "name": "PG mcp_reader"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const event = $('Normalize Event').first().json;\nconst order = $input.first().json;\nconst REFUND_APPROVAL_THRESHOLD = 100000;\nconst LATE_HEAVY = 20;\n\nlet kind = 'ignore';\nlet amount = 0;\nlet needsApproval = false;\n\nif (event.event === 'delivery.late') {\n  kind = 'voucher';\n  const late = Number(event.minutes_late || 0);\n  amount = late >= LATE_HEAVY ? 25000 : 10000;\n} else if (event.event === 'order.failed') {\n  if (order.payment_status !== 'captured') {\n    kind = 'skip_unpaid';\n  } else {\n    kind = 'refund';\n    amount = Number(order.total_amount);\n    needsApproval = amount >= REFUND_APPROVAL_THRESHOLD;\n  }\n}\n\nconst idempotencyKey = `${kind}:${event.order_id}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...event,\n    ...order,\n    kind,\n    amount,\n    needsApproval,\n    idempotencyKey,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "45ca1d5f-d1ce-4c50-89a3-0f7cc606fa7d",
      "name": "Apply Policy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        976,
        352
      ]
    },
